# The Telegram bot (docs/telegram.md): people link their Telegram account in the profile, get their
# notifications in the chat and use the product's commands there. Empty token means the bot is off:
# no route answers for it and nothing calls Telegram. The token comes from @BotFather; the username
# is the bot's, without @. Production takes Telegram's calls at https://<DOMAIN>/api/webhooks/telegram
# and needs the secret Telegram sends with each one: openssl rand -hex 32. With ENV=dev the API polls
# Telegram instead and needs no secret; TELEGRAM_POLLING=true or false overrides that choice.
# TELEGRAM_API_URL names a local Bot API server; empty means https://api.telegram.org.
