# The dev SPA container runs Vite. Held to 1 CPU and 512M it restarted in a loop (esbuild, which
# Vite starts, ended with "all goroutines are asleep - deadlock!"); at 2 CPUs and 2G it still
# restarted once in the first minute. 4 CPUs and 4G stayed up for 11 minutes from a fresh stack.
# These are limits, not use: the container idles far below them. Production serves static files and
# needs much less.
