# Backups, with `backup` in COMPOSE_PROFILES (docs/backups.md). The repository is a restic
# address, such as s3:https://s3.example.com/app-backups; one repository per project (an sftp:
# address does not work: the image has no SSH client). Each snapshot carries PROJECT as its host.
# Without the password nothing in the repository can be read, so keep a copy of it away from the
# server. The two keys are for an S3 repository.
